      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"text\": \"What the Pixaroma Group adds over a ComfyUI group:\\n- Separate title + body colours, each with its own opacity (a ComfyUI group has one flat colour)\\n- A node-count badge in the header (this one shows 2)\\n- Resize from ALL FOUR corners (a ComfyUI group resizes from the bottom-right only)\\n- Fold the whole group down to a slim bar: its nodes and wires tuck away to tidy the canvas\\n- Hover the header for one-click buttons: Run, Mute, Bypass, Fold, Colour\\n- Run just this group (queues only its output nodes); Mute / Bypass reach inside subgraphs\\n- Snaps into line with the Align tool, and groups can be nested inside each other\", \"fontSize\": 13, \"fontFamily\": \"Arial\", \"fontColor\": \"#c0c0c0\", \"textAlign\": \"left\", \"backgroundColor\": \"#333333\", \"padding\": 10, \"borderRadius\": 0, \"opacity\": 1, \"fontWeight\": \"normal\", \"lineHeight\": 1.45}"
